look best. Next is 2 (1.0× for product 0, 1.2× for product 1), then 7 (≈1.25×, too much bought and written off).\n- Every-3-day plans: they save 180 in order fees but pay about 300 more in holding costs. Candidate 1 (≈1.1×) is better than candidate 0 (≈1.2×). Candidate 0 also comes close to the 188 limit.\n\nMy top four are 4, 6, 1 and 2, with 0 and 7 as close alternatives."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5056, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5056}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T08:18:04.079Z", "request_id": "req_011CgWCS4SoCh9acsHhd9DuU"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01Eq5zTHjRboAedaDrSPkvsf", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgWCS4iBNZxAa9jKwEMJM", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01Eq5zTHjRboAedaDrSPkvsf", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.4, 0.62, 0.55, 0.12, 0.68, 0.15, 0.72, 0.38]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5056, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5056}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": 